+        "why": "This is on the slop list as an unused member. The grant step looks the identity up by appName, so nothing reads principalId.",
+        "route_to": "builder"
+      },
+      {
+        "id": "R4",
+        "rule_id": "code-quality: speculative generality",
+        "severity": "P2",
+        "file": "infrastructure/main.bicep",
+        "line": 31,
+        "what": "tenantId is a parameter with a zero-GUID placeholder in all three param files and a pipeline override, though a subscription deployment already knows its tenant",
+        "why": "tenant().tenantId is available at subscription scope. The parameter adds a placeholder per environment, a variable-group entry and an override argument to the what-if and create commands, and no rule needs any of them.",
